Actually, I said she abandoned me to write jingles.

25
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:37,070
Uh, anything we might've heard of?

26
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:39,280
Uh, yeah, um...

27
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:50,290
