No, but thanks.

34
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:11,890
Oh, come on, Phoebe. Would you just think about it?

35
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,610
Okay.

36
00:03:14,770 --> 00:03:16,110
No, but thanks.

37
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:22,070
Okay, uh...

38
