53
00:04:12,410 --> 00:04:15,170
Ha, ha.

54
00:04:16,670 --> 00:04:19,090
You know what, uh, Gunther? Go, uh... Go ahead.

55
00:04:19,250 --> 00:04:21,420
I'm talking to, uh...

56
