57
00:04:25,010 --> 00:04:28,470
Ginger.

58
00:04:25,010 --> 00:04:28,470
Ginger. I'm talking to Ginger, so...

59
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:35,350
Don't you have to use the bathroom?

60
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:35,350
No.

61
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:38,360
No, I just, uh... I'd rather, uh, talk to you.

62
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,980
Yes, I do.

63
00:04:41,530 --> 00:04:44,070
Yes, I do have to go to the bathroom.

64
00:04:44,530 --> 00:04:46,530
Someone in here.

65
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:50,160
Where's Chandler?

66
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:50,160
He can't make it.

67
00:04:50,330 --> 00:04:53,250
He said he had to go back to his, uh, job to do, uh...

68
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:57,080
Joey?

69
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,210
Joey Tribbiani?

70
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:08,140
Joey, I can see you, okay?

71
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:10,720
You're hiding behind the coats.

72
00:05:21,650 --> 00:05:23,440
