84
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:54,060
Oh, hey. But that's sad about you, though. What happened?

85
00:05:54,220 --> 00:05:57,680
What happened? Burn out? Burn all out, did you?

86
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,730
