87
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:05,070
Oh, well, that's great. So I guess this is, uh, goodbye then.

88
00:06:05,230 --> 00:06:06,740
Goodbye. Ha, ha.

89
00:06:08,910 --> 00:06:10,700
Okay, then.

90
00:06:08,910 --> 00:06:10,700
Okay.

91
