Well, we're gonna miss you around here.

92
00:06:13,450 --> 00:06:15,200
Yeah, me too.

93
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:20,620
So see you on Saturday.

94
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:20,620
Yeah, you bet.

95
00:06:39,980 --> 00:06:42,350
Now, you know those are a delicacy in India.

96
00:06:43,940 --> 00:06:47,530
