You two must've been so cute running around on a barge.

102
00:07:05,670 --> 00:07:07,840
You never run on a barge.

103
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:12,090
Hey.

104
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:12,090
Hey.

105
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:13,680
Is, uh...? Is Chandler around?

106
00:07:13,850 --> 00:07:16,560
No, um, he met some girl at the coffeehouse.

107
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:18,310
