The movie star.

114
00:07:35,410 --> 00:07:36,450
Oh, man.

115
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:38,700
That's the girl I was hiding from.

116
00:07:38,870 --> 00:07:41,540
When she finds out he's my roommate, she'll tell him what I did.

117
00:07:41,710 --> 00:07:45,750
What did you do?

118
00:07:41,710 --> 00:07:45,750
Oh. Oh, no, no. I can't...

119
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:49,090
I can't tell you that. It's like the most awful, horrible thing...

120
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:52,220
...I've ever done in my whole life.

121
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:52,220
You know what? Don't tell us.

122
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:55,010
We'll wait till Chandler gets home because it'll be more fun.

123
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:56,510
All right.

124
00:07:58,100 --> 00:08:00,560
Okay, it was, like, four years ago.

125
00:08:00,730 --> 00:08:03,770
Okay, Ginger and I had gone out a few times. Then one weekend...

126
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:05,440
...we went to her dad's cabin...

127
00:08:05,610 --> 00:08:09,690
...just me, her and her annoying little dog, Pepper. Heh.

128
00:08:09,860 --> 00:08:12,820
Well, that night I cooked this really romantic dinner...

129
00:08:12,990 --> 00:08:15,240
