145
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,970
Actually, me too.

146
00:09:20,470 --> 00:09:22,640
Oh. Foot in a puddle. Foot all in the puddle.

147
00:09:22,810 --> 00:09:25,140
Oh, damn. I hate that.

148
00:09:25,310 --> 00:09:27,140
