153
00:09:38,530 --> 00:09:40,570
Someday. Maybe.

154
00:09:51,210 --> 00:09:52,670
Funny book?

155
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:58,130
Hmm? Oh, no, no. I'm just thinking about something funny I heard today.

156
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:02,220
Um, Mark saying, "I'll see you Saturday."

157
00:10:04,470 --> 00:10:05,720
Yeah, at the lecture.

158
