I would love to go with you.

174
00:10:56,730 --> 00:10:57,860
Really?

175
00:10:56,730 --> 00:10:57,860
Yeah.

176
00:10:58,030 --> 00:11:01,660
Hey, I have clothes. I even pick them out.

177
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:05,120
I mean, for all you know, I could be a fashion...

178
00:11:05,910 --> 00:11:06,950
...monger.

179
00:11:11,370 --> 00:11:15,250
Okay. Honey, I would love for you to go with me.

180
00:11:15,540 --> 00:11:16,920
What?

181
