182
00:11:29,810 --> 00:11:33,140
You know, they say, "A watched pot never beeps."

183
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:38,440
It's, you know, ahem... It's been a couple hours...

184
00:11:38,940 --> 00:11:40,780
