189
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:53,960
Well, don't you wanna?

190
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:53,960
Yeah.

191
00:11:55,130 --> 00:11:58,840
Okay, so I do know you.

192
00:11:55,130 --> 00:11:58,840
