193
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:03,590
Well, so?

194
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:03,590
I can't.

195
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:06,050
I can't. She dumped me.

196
00:12:06,260 --> 00:12:08,760
I mean, I totally trusted her, and then one day it was like:

197
