I'm really glad we came.

203
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,760
You're so pretty.

204
00:13:34,140 --> 00:13:35,890
I love you.

205
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:54,990
Wow, that's great.

206
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:58,160
Oh, yeah?

207
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:58,160
You know, you could totally sell this.

208
00:13:58,330 --> 00:14:02,250
It'd be perfect for, like, um, a kitty-litter campaign.

209
00:14:03,090 --> 00:14:05,340
A jingle? No, no, no.

210
00:14:05,510 --> 00:14:07,170
Why not? You make a ton of money.

211
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:10,840
Okay, if I was in this for the money, I'd be a millionaire by now, you know?

212
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,970
You gotta get out of that jingle-head, sweetie.

213
00:14:15,980 --> 00:14:18,770
Ugh. You're right. You're right. I'm sorry.

214
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:20,060
That's okay.

215
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:20,060
Okay.

216
00:14:20,230 --> 00:14:23,190
All right, I'm gonna play a song now that's really, really sad.

217
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:26,400
Okay.

218
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:26,400
Okay, it's called "Magician Box Mix-Up."

219
00:14:31,740 --> 00:14:34,620
Oversized bracelets, oversized earrings...

220
00:14:34,790 --> 00:14:38,620
