221
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:51,510
Hi.

222
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:51,510
Hey.

223
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:53,550
Oh, can I borrow this? My milk's gone bad.

224
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,050
Oh, I hate that.

225
00:14:55,220 --> 00:14:58,310
I once had a thing of half-and-half. Stole my car.

226
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:03,230
So how was your date with Ginger?

227
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:07,730
Great. Ahem. It was great. She's, uh...

228
00:15:07,900 --> 00:15:10,860
She's great. Great looking, great personality. She's greatness.

229
00:15:12,950 --> 00:15:15,030
Sounds like she's got the, uh...

230
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:17,330
...whole package.

231
